                                    ?.copyWith(fontWeight: FontWeight.w600),
                              ),
                              if ((actedBy?.isNotEmpty ?? false) ||
                                  actedAt != null)
                                Padding(
                                  padding:
                                      const EdgeInsets.only(top: AppSpacing.xs),
                                  child: Text(
                                    _actionLine(actedBy, actedAt),
